          "explanation": "The Party Central Committee rule on relatives' business activities is a real anti-conflict measure, even if it does not prove Xi's own family was implicated."
        }
      ],
      "inherited_baseline_and_constraints": "No structured local priors were collected. China's closed information environment means the absence of direct personal scandal evidence cannot be treated as proof of integrity, but the score must still rest on ruler-specific conduct rather than system opacity alone.",
      "ruler_attribution": "Moderately direct on elite consolidation and institutional personalization, but weak on direct personal enrichment or a documented lie-and-correction episode. The main signal is controlled, loyalist governance rather than proven private self-dealing.",
      "supported_lenses": [
        "7B.3",
