      "inherited_baseline_and_constraints": "No structured local priors were collected. Germany's strong institutions are context only; the score turns on Scholz's own testimony, legal scrutiny, and the absence of a direct finding of deceit or self-dealing.",
      "ruler_attribution": "Direct on his testimony and on the accountability setting around Cum-Ex, but weak on any proven personal benefit. The dossier shows a politician under scrutiny, not a ruler proven to have used office for private gain.",
